1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,500
We are the Borg.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,500
Lower your shields and surrender your ships.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
We will add your biological and technological
distinctiveness to our own.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:16,500
Your culture will adapt to service us.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Resistance is futile.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,500
I am Locutus of Borg.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,500
Resistance is futile.
Your life as it has been is over.

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,500
From this time forward, you will service us.

9
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:41,500
You will become one with the Borg.

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Strength is irrelevant.

11
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,500
Freedom is irrelevant.
Self-determination is irrelevant.

12
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,500
You must comply.

13
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Death is irrelevant.

14
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000
We have analysed your defensive capabilities.

15
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,500
Resistance is futile.

16
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,500
Existence, as you know it, is over.

17
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,000
We are the Borg.
